        },
        {
            "+content": "This is Tablo—a city where everything about books gathers. Spica, an elf girl who arrives longing to become a bookbinder, begs the young master craftsman, Leathac, to take her in. Though Leathac coldly dismisses her for being \"unable to read,\" he soon finds himself captivated by her wondrous charm: her ability to \"hear the voices of books.\" And so, he decides to accept her as his apprentice. Between the innocent, deeply sensitive Spica, and the brilliant but blunt artisan Leathac, the story of these two begins now—.",
